    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi yenu nindi, Kundejenu antu ami, yikundejenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu damukwakubilela nindi, Loŋeshenu njila yaYehova mwisaŋa, ololenu mukwakwa waNzambi yetu mwikuna, yinekineki yejima akayishikila, mapidi ejima niyilundalunda yejima akayishikumuna. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hahepahakoloka, hadiŋi mankulokela akalambishahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulema kwaYehova kwakamwekana, antu ejima akakumwena hamu, muloŋa kanwa kaYehovakanahoshi dehi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu damuntu hidikwila nindi, Bidikaku. Mukwawu nindi, Nukubidikadi? Nindi, Antu ejima himatahu, kuwaha kwawu kwejima kudi neyiwuluya wamumpata; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "matahu omaŋa, wuluya walepukaŋa muloŋa muuya waYehova wayipepaŋa. Mwalala antu himatahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matahu omaŋa, wuluya walepukapa, hakwila izu daNzambi yetu sapa dakolela haya nyaka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lebanoni hashikila mukwochaku, nianyama aduhu hiyashikila muhimulambu wakushitaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyuza yejima wayimona neyi hichumaku; wayifuukula nindi hela muchuma hiyashikamwokuku, amukunkulwayi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ochu Nzambi mukumufwikŋa neyinyi? Chifwikijanyi chimuku mwesekeja nachu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukishi wakusoŋa musupununaŋa kudi mukwawukalawenu, muchi wawuru hakulamika lamikahu wuru, hakumusupunwina maleŋa asiliva. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kazweŋi, wukukananva himulambu wudochu, wukutonda mutondu wakatokapa; hakuya nakukeŋa mukwawukala wenu wasweja wukalawenu, amwilili mukishi wakusoŋa wabulapa kunyinkesha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyi Yakoba, welilaŋadi, eyi Isarela, wahoshelaŋa adi, neyi, Njila yamiyinabuli kumwekana kudi Yehova, wuŋa aji wakunhoshela wunahiti dehi, wunafumi dehi kudi Nzambi yami? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiwunelukuku? Hiwunatiyuku? Nzambi wahaya nyaka, Yehova, Nleŋi wansa jeseki, hazeyaloŋaku, hija muhwaŋaku. Kwosi wukushinshika mwaya kashinshi kinduku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamwinkapa muntu wazeya wuswa, wabula Ŋovu wainuvulishilaŋa Ŋovu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyikwenzi akuzeya, jikuyihwa, ansanda akudimbuka bulukutu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 40:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hakwinza awa achiŋililaŋa Yehova, Ŋovu jawu jakabalumuka jajiha; akajindama nampuula hewulu jinda-a neyi ambuulu; akenda lufuchi chakubula kuyihwa, akenda chakubula kuzeya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.40.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.40.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
